<h4 nodeId="1997e70e669b46e0b9e4f713cd960eb6">特征在zeus中应用</h4>
<table borderColor="#cccccc" responsive="false" nodeId="defafbefff3c432b88513bd1c948137c">
<tr nodeId="a449b97d7b944032b916f7abc337aac4">
<th colwidth="[432]" nodeId="2dd170c8162a4014b021a873bc4bf50d">
<p nodeId="7bbf48fb16a94f70897ff99c2cc0e733"><span font-size="14">说明</span></p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[727]" nodeId="8b6b92329df242bcb4d1cae8285fa9b5">
<p nodeId="a3c44fbe04064e1ea262ba256181046f"><span font-size="14">页面</span></p>
</th>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="6e122edfc2094f59a38ef67cf0c0320f">
<td colwidth="[432]" nodeId="61cd8bc9ccc842dba1cb8b75e2510fce">
<ol nodeId="018c852263144fa8ad59081bb2a20562">
<li nodeId="4673841c78e74000816bbc9b8a377a60"><span font-size="14">特征启用后会进行计算，同时自动注册一个同名参数到zeus中，同时注册对应的数据接口；</span></li>
<li nodeId="c0f928a476fa496a8b12f3d99839f2d3"><span font-size="14">特征详情页会出现“数据接口”模块，点击数据接口，可超链接至zeus中数据接口编辑模块；</span></li>
<li nodeId="5b5e62d020b14123bd48c8ee47832a52"><span font-size="14">为保证获取特征的准确性，需要用户修改输入映射配置。</span></li>
<li nodeId="4b9b9f8ea0f54e68863dd56ddc0cb977"><span font-size="14">具体数据接口配置可参考</span><a href="https://km.sankuai.com/page/182702174" title="https://km.sankuai.com/page/182702174" autoUpdate="true" nodeId="e89c46c2f6c0484c9912137ddfcd23cc"><span font-size="14">https://km.sankuai.com/page/182702174</span></a></li>
<li nodeId="4fbdf114f4c640a49ba71726ada242ee"><span font-size="14">当数据接口配置完成后，可在zeus规则配置中直接应用该特征</span></li>
</ol>
</td>
<td colwidth="[727]" nodeId="5c39d14a06674b0fa28590d1156608fb">
