<h4 nodeId="a8f6c3c055f54ceb8c096ee0f5a39487">评估</h4>
<table borderColor="#cccccc" responsive="false" nodeId="7bf588ee1cd14852a4c74ee6815529a7">
<tr nodeId="4bcd7fd3d0664c77acd2f4f9803b3dd9">
<th colwidth="[431]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(246, 246, 246)" nodeId="b6f12cd1ef844538a3e32c08d7a529f1">
<p nodeId="8c5e08c0efb84871a228562584d6abb8"><span font-size="14">说明</span></p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[899]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(246, 246, 246)" nodeId="62d2c62110f74c258d757199219f91e7">
<p nodeId="abe76f8ffe8447c9a74bc92de4bbdd03"><span font-size="14">页面</span></p>
</th>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="4c197f25800a4d3bb491aa2297596bb6">
<td colwidth="[431]" nodeId="ea68dffbe09f450c8de6a9024fad2028">
<p nodeId="a72ced8f7ecb4c7fb12cb81cec8dd010"><span font-size="14"><strong>数据源评估</strong></span></p>
<p nodeId="2e8394045cbe4c2c9c7f07638075c3a1"><span font-size="14"><strong>【入口】</strong></span></p>
<p nodeId="892108f6601c423693961e3518e74222"><span font-size="14">zeus-特征中心-数据源管理-数据源评估tab</span></p>
<p nodeId="743befae88b641e6abdf8826a4df9e36"><span font-size="14"><strong>【新建】</strong></span></p>
<ol nodeId="b6275c3e1bbc4ef596662a02ebbfd085">
<li nodeId="2aff7be151ed46be80d66e76e325f40f"><span font-size="14">点击右上角「新建评估」，跳出评估配置弹框：</span></li>
<li nodeId="78171fd91fa849639b23533f54536066"><span font-size="14">可以选择指定数据源表；</span></li>
<li nodeId="0b6c5023abae46969481f86aeae9239c"><span font-size="14">选定数据源表后，可以对数据源表重的指定几个字段、或者全部字段进行评估数据质量；</span></li>
<li nodeId="217d710b497e47d88857bafb3f9e71c0"><span font-size="14">时间：选定某时间的字段数据；</span></li>
<li nodeId="be8028efa2304952ba78e3c1c9fb85cf"><span font-size="14">评估指标：具体可参考</span><a href="https://km.sankuai.com/page/1227050269" title="https://km.sankuai.com/page/1227050269" autoUpdate="true" nodeId="23a66ae0b556429ebb894254dd9c76b8"><span font-size="14">https://km.sankuai.com/page/1227050269</span></a><span font-size="14">，指标支持多选或全选；如果所选字段不符合指标的计算逻辑，即使选中了，也不会计算；</span></li>
<li nodeId="b14357220dbc4b08a822a9a447a13db3"><span font-size="14">任务名称/任务备注：用户自定义输入，便于区分；</span></li>
<li nodeId="530608891edb41d08a4b553d0164a2cc"><span font-size="14">点击确认则生成任务，在列表也展示</span></li>
<li nodeId="56ab7067a3db49feb57919177baa245a"><span font-size="14">任务生成后不可删除、不可修改</span></li>
<li nodeId="ed07825bfec84a92b6ce8f4df4c75d6d"><span font-size="14">任务状态为：待评估、评估中、评估完成。</span></li>
<li nodeId="1cad4165e8f740fe99ea7e8842e48cd4"><span font-size="14">点击评估名称，可超链接至魔数查看评估结果；（魔数表名：</span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)"><span font-size="14">log.rc_zeus_feature_evaluation_result）</span></span></li>
</ol>
</td>
<td colwidth="[899]" nodeId="a786a627a7374b3faac52b7ac265143a">
