</tr>
<tr nodeId="75feb8db33ef42dbb89145b80bb0c85c">
<td colwidth="[431]" nodeId="bbfdcca6ceff4c16953668d85edd7544">
<p nodeId="13137c886b45417091cebb1fded2fafb"><span font-size="14"><strong>特征评估</strong></span></p>
<p nodeId="a955a65a0bc24cdca32941d6ca22b609"><span font-size="14"><strong>【入口】</strong></span></p>
<p nodeId="e97c4ebdc6394824b0917d8ba375d244"><span font-size="14">zeus-特征中心-特征管理-特征详情页-评估按钮</span></p>
<p nodeId="656d813ae3164c4eb0d78fb2a3df53cb"><span font-size="14"><strong>【新建】</strong></span></p>
<ol nodeId="3aea761385fd4a96acf9a7be0065974b">
<li nodeId="30d0d3156ac342178789d37e36a6e2f0"><span font-size="14">点击右上角「评估」，跳出评估配置弹框：</span></li>
<li nodeId="ec7d27865e494454883256a79365ccd3"><span font-size="14">时间：选定某时间的字段数据；</span></li>
<li nodeId="0a16a1bd7c6d4fd59bb6b98fa7a9454d"><span font-size="14">评估指标：具体可参考</span><a href="https://km.sankuai.com/page/1227050269" title="https://km.sankuai.com/page/1227050269" autoUpdate="true" nodeId="4142fe880b34480d8ada4076a2d2909e"><span font-size="14">https://km.sankuai.com/page/1227050269</span></a><span font-size="14">，指标支持多选或全选；如果所选字段不符合指标的计算逻辑，即使选中了，也不会计算；</span></li>
<li nodeId="71be0fca87e64100ad4e16c3ddf3289e"><span font-size="14">任务备注：用户自定义输入，便于区分；</span></li>
<li nodeId="040c0177da3e4b7ea7efbc2b785f76ea"><span font-size="14">点击确认则生成任务，在特征评估列表页展示和特征详情页的「评估信息」模块展示</span></li>
<li nodeId="d97ac3fe5a754a2698ff7a52aed299c3"><span font-size="14">任务生成后不可删除、不可修改</span></li>
<li nodeId="db4079440c84445cbae038d7c7a74623"><span font-size="14">任务状态为：待评估、评估中、评估完成。</span></li>
<li nodeId="5590a202d28e4c7b9e0bd4f430181490"><span font-size="14">点击评估名称，可超链接至魔数查看评估结果（魔数表名：</span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)"><span font-size="14">log.rc_zeus_feature_evaluation_result）</span></span></li>
</ol>
</td>
